{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03282","headline":"答李司户夔 · 宋之问","name":"答李司户夔","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"远方来下客，輶轩摄使臣。\n弄琴宜在夜，倾酒贵逢春。\n驷马留孤馆，双鱼赠故人。\n明朝散云雨，遥仰德爲邻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03282.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03282","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}